{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102104","id":2301007202,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6JJpVi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102104","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102104.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102104.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102104","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102104/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102104/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102104/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f7d1558bc0c539865ae0c158c0afb7ac3cadd8c7","number":102104,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Embedded Game disappear when not focused on KDE 5","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #102043\r\n\r\nThis PR resolves the issue where the Embedded Game Window disappears when the Floating Game Window is not focused on Xorg/Kubuntu.\r\n\r\nOn Ubuntu 24.04 Gnome and Fedora 40 KDE Plasma 6.1.5, a window of type `_NET_WM_WINDOW_TYPE_UTILITY` remains visible even when the parent window is not focused. However, on Kubuntu/KDE (tested on Kubuntu 22.04 and KDE Plasma 5.24.7), this type of window is hidden when the parent window loses focus, causing the Embedded Game Window to disappear.\r\n\r\nTo address this, this PR changes the window type to `_NET_WM_WINDOW_TYPE_NORMAL`. A side effect of this change is that the Embedded Game Window now appears in the alt-tab window list. I tested several window types, but none could simultaneously prevent the window from disappearing when the parent is not focused and exclude it from the alt-tab list. Although the `_set_window_taskbar_pager_enabled` method was designed for this purpose, it does not seem to work on Kubuntu/KDE. Given the circumstances, I believe this trade-off is acceptable.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url